      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met overall through repeated screening for finger color, temperature, severe pain, swelling, and neurologic worsening with same-day/emergency escalation thresholds, despite not being maximally complete on capillary-refill wording.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
