      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00153",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a definitive clopidogrel continuation instruction rather than deferring perioperative antiplatelet timing to the responsible clinicians.",
          "quote": "波立维/氯吡格雷和以前的前列腺药，维持原来的长期剂量和时间，今晚照常"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 has a serious commission error. The case required avoiding unsupported individualized perioperative clopidogrel orders and verifying with the surgical team/original prescriber; the doctor instead instructed continued dosing.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
