          "quote": "伸直受限可\"被动\"帮忙扳直"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The same early advice included warm soaking and progressive activity despite postoperative wound uncertainty.",
          "quote": "每天温水泡手后轻柔牵伸5分钟"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 has a serious commission error. The doctor later corrected the family to avoid soaking and hard passive manipulation, but the initial actionable advice violated the rehabilitation boundary for this postoperative episode.",
